cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SFRIS: Systematic Fragmentation-Recombination Isomer Search"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the preprint below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Dapeng
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2879-5613"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Sendai, Miyagi, Japan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/HalstenZhang/SFRIS"
url: "https://halsten.pcmq.net/sfris"
abstract: >-
  SFRIS generates constitutional isomers by systematic bond cleavage of an
  input structure, deterministic placement and recombination of the resulting
  fragments using Fibonacci sphere sampling, and refinement through a
  two-stage optimization workflow.
keywords:
  - constitutional isomers
  - isomer enumeration
  - computational chemistry
  - fragmentation and recombination
